{"ID":"20260206192314-s2ofdp1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f383","id":"20260206192314-s2ofdp1","tags":"CNN,神经网络基础学习,经典卷积神经网络架构","title":"GoogleNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260206203006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192334-3j81jow","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260206192334-3j81jow","updated":"20260206202940"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-b2hq6q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-b2hq6q0","updated":"20260206192335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Google"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"公司于2014年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Going Deeper with Convolutions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-sl789gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-sl789gr","updated":"20260206202940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的网络架构可以说是开创新的一种网络架构，不仅仅是前一代"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206201501-cw8y94v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"NIN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络的延续同时也是神经网络模型在宽度方面开枝散叶的第一人。是神经网络向着宽度领域迈出的一大步。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192337-gctzbps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192337-gctzbps","updated":"20260206201902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192338-7cgqg0i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-w900q3w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-w900q3w","updated":"20260206203006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型设计背景"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-8a21yrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-8a21yrs","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2014"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年前后那个时代应该说是卷积神经网络大爆发的一个时代，各种新点子层出不穷，人们在目标检测以及分类工作上取得了巨大的成功。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-suz7i2d","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-suz7i2d","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-jhk2c14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-jhk2c14","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在论文中也提到了“现在的目标检测和目标分类的任务获得如此好的效果不仅仅归功于好的硬件，大的数据集等；最主要的还是大家的想法，算法，模型等的创新”"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-yo6hv3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-yo6hv3w","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当时的阶段人们在提高神经网络模型效果主要是采用两种方式："}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-nw0bnhe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-nw0bnhe","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-xim70if","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-xim70if","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-yyj076x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-yyj076x","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提高网络层数-深度"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-qvj5r4b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-qvj5r4b","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-80mzltu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-80mzltu","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提高单层网络的通道数量-宽度"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-j6bwb59","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-j6bwb59","updated":"20260206201910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-ge01vgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-ge01vgr","updated":"20260206192342"}},{"ID":"20260206192345-4qv3jh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192345-4qv3jh9","updated":"20260206201910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192346-c6ayvdx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192351-wsglwax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192351-wsglwax","updated":"20260206192351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上面的图片可以看成是一个神经网络系统模型。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-4oh5ijp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-4oh5ijp","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宽度就是单个层最大的红色圈圈的数量，也就是有几行。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-usltzu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-usltzu4","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度就是总共的层数，也就是有几列。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-xf0wj70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-xf0wj70","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是如果仅仅一味的提高模型深度会导致训练的参数量过大，出现过拟合的现象；同时不断地拉高宽度会导致模型的计算量过大，造成计算资源的极大浪费。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-zlhnyzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-zlhnyzf","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此趁着"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2014"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 年 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大规模视觉识别挑战赛 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"(ILSVRC14)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开赛的关节之上，Google公司带着他的巨作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来了。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-hgtrugh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-hgtrugh","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该网络整体采用分支的结构，在增强特征融合以及信息采集的同时降低计算量。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-rxw93vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-rxw93vt","updated":"20260206202959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并且在前人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206201501-cw8y94v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"NIN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​网络的启发之下，非常启发性的使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1×1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的卷积神经网络不仅仅为了一部分的特征提取，更为了使用它来降低运算过程中的维度过大的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-agscecq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-agscecq","updated":"20260206203006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"((VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206201501-cw8y94v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"NIN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的启发之下，也使用了一种块而来完美的集成在网络之中。可以说是卷"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"积神经网络中的卷积神经网络"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-3y2nfqy","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-3y2nfqy","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-e9d6ssz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-e9d6ssz","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"站在当时的角度想一想看，这个GoogleNet主要就是解决了当时的其中的几个问题，并且将之前人们模型的好处进行了提取，融入自己的同时发散思维大力创新。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-6x49xwt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-6x49xwt","updated":"20260206202005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型整体框架"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-a54uu9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-a54uu9e","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个模型最重要的我认为并不是他的整体架构是如何设计的，更重要的是其中一个模块的设计，在论文中对该模块的命名为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Inception"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个模块也是整个模型最重要的创新点。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-fy4ht7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-fy4ht7j","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在对该模块进行剖析。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Inception"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块如下图所示"}]},{"ID":"20260206192355-myotrj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192355-myotrj6","updated":"20260206201922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192356-4zf3h4f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-a530itg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-a530itg","updated":"20260206192355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先偏向理性的对这个模块进行说明：这个模块的信息流流向是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"从下到上"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的上一步骤的图片进入的模型之中形成产生了四个分支，从左往右分别为："}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-oihkdyh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-oihkdyh","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-90dq6jx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-90dq6jx","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-4lqf6k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-4lqf6k8","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 大小的一次小型卷积操作；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-njc9soi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-njc9soi","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-dxfg4r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-dxfg4r1","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先进行1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 大小的一次小型卷积操作，然后进行3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 3 大小的一次中型卷积操作；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-wh5dk57","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-wh5dk57","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-k6ibdpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-k6ibdpp","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先进行1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 大小的一次小型卷积操作，然后进行5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 5 大小的一次大型卷积操作；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-yua0484","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-yua0484","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-3zmuyzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-3zmuyzm","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先进行3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 3 大小的一次最大池化操作，然后进行1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 大小的一次小型卷积操作；"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-j4xta7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-j4xta7e","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个分支操作完毕之后，得到了四组矩阵然后将这四组矩阵进行拼接即可得到模块的输出。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-2ax5bvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-2ax5bvv","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么为什么要这么设计呢，现在用偏向感性的想法进行思考，可能有点不对，但应该有助于理解吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-refmsb5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-refmsb5","updated":"20260206201953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-jjtyydh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-jjtyydh","updated":"20260206201953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-e4ytxci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-e4ytxci","updated":"20260206201953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左侧蓝色的1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 大小的一次小型卷积操作，在这个分支1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 1 的卷积核有了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用处，这个东西是可以实现跨通道融合的一个事情。实际上它可以用一个公式表示一下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Y_{c_out,h,w} = Σ_{c_in=1}^{C_in} W_{c_out,c_in} · X_{c_in,h,w} + b_{c_out}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个的本质其实就是，基本卷积运算。这个操作就想到把各个通道融合在一起做了一件事情。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-ar6x1na","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-ar6x1na","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-si4j9zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-si4j9zk","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相当于对输入的图片做了通道处理，以及特征重组操作，并没有对空间做事情。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-hz8y57h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-hz8y57h","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里也可以说，小的视野关注小的物体，主要就是为了较小目标的识别"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-at4ccfu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-at4ccfu","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-o5g7xei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-o5g7xei","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个分支也就是中间的先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".这里的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1×1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积的目的已经不再是为了进行通道混合出特征了，而是为了降低维度也就是降低通道数，降低后续"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3×3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的计算量。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-9go2d69","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-9go2d69","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-bqecedy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-bqecedy","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里也可以说，中等目标关注的就是中等目标的事情"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-ieob8yd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-ieob8yd","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-hrp2ght","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-hrp2ght","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三个分支与第二个分支有异曲同工之妙。只不过换个大视野的玩意儿罢了"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-w0s1mmk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-w0s1mmk","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192324-dufh0se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-dufh0se","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四个分支先进行最大池化，然后进行"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1×1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的卷积操作。池化就两个事情，第一个下采样，找到最显著的特征，第二个降低空间尺寸大小。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1×1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积就不再多说了也是老生常谈的更改维度的作用。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-p64r0s3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-p64r0s3","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-yby2i3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-yby2i3f","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Inception"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体模块的一些事情他其实就是在一个模块中探索多种可能行，用不同的视野不同的方式来看世界"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-ksakqj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-ksakqj4","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可谓是优雅"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-x2ybpwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-x2ybpwu","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到这里"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的最值得说的也就说完了。他的整体框架就放在下面，可以复现一下试试效果。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192404-0aulubp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192404-0aulubp","updated":"20260206202005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 67vh;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192405-tzdsknq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 67vh;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-xcqsirt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-xcqsirt","updated":"20260206192420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 代码实现"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-xpwo009","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-xpwo009","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Inception"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的代码实现"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-z8y5wpm","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-z8y5wpm","updated":"20260206192411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" import torch \n import torch.nn as nn\n ​\n class InceptionBlock(nn.Module):\n     '''Googlenet 的 Inception 模块\n     Args:\n         in_channels: 输入的通道数\n     Returns: \n     '''\n     def __init__(self , in_channels , out_1x1 ,  out_3x3_reduce , out_3x3 , out_5x5_reduce , out_5x5 , out_pool_proj):\n         super(InceptionBlock, self).__init__()\n         '''inception 模块包含四个并行的分支：\n             Args:\n                 in_channels: 输入的通道数\n                 out_1x1: 1x1 卷积层输出的通道数\n                 out_3x3_reduce: 3x3 卷积层前的降维 1x1 卷积层输出的通道数\n                 out_3x3: 3x3 卷积层输出的通道数\n                 out_5x5_reduce: 5x5 卷积层前的降维 1x1 卷积层输出的通道数\n                 out_5x5: 5x5 卷积层输出的通道数\n                 out_pool_proj: 池化层后 1x1 卷积层输出的通道数 \n         '''\n ​\n         # 1x1 卷积层\n         self.branch1x1 = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = in_channels , out_channels = out_1x1 , kernel_size = 1),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_1x1),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n         )\n ​\n         # 3x3 卷积层\n         self.branch3x3 = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = in_channels , out_channels = out_3x3_reduce , kernel_size=1), # 用1x1 卷积进行降维\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_3x3_reduce),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = out_3x3_reduce , out_channels = out_3x3 , kernel_size=3 , padding=1),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_3x3),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n         )\n ​\n         # 5x5 卷积层\n         self.branch5x5 = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = in_channels , out_channels = out_5x5_reduce , kernel_size=1), # 用1x1 卷积进行降维\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_5x5_reduce),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = out_5x5_reduce , out_channels = out_5x5 , kernel_size=5 , padding=2),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_5x5),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n         )\n ​\n         # 最大池化层\n         self.poolbranch = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=1 , padding=1),\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = in_channels , out_channels = out_pool_proj , kernel_size=1),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(out_pool_proj),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n         )\n         \n     def forward(self , x):\n         branch1x1 = self.branch1x1(x)\n         branch3x3 = self.branch3x3(x)\n         branch5x5 = self.branch5x5(x)\n         branchpool = self.poolbranch(x)\n ​\n         out = torch.cat([branch1x1 , branch3x3 , branch5x5 , branchpool], dim=1) # (batch_size, channels, height, width) ,channels维度拼接\n ​\n         return out\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-ev5gu54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-ev5gu54","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来就是基于原论文的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码框架实现"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-as0rj20","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-as0rj20","updated":"20260206192415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" import torch \n import torch.nn as nn\n ​\n class GoogleNet(nn.Module):\n     def __init__(self , num_classes=1000):\n         super(GoogleNet , self).__init__()\n         '''Googlenet 网络结构\n         '''\n         self.googleNet = nn.Sequential(\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 3 , out_channels = 64 , kernel_size = 7 , stride = 2 , padding = 3),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(64),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n ​\n             nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 64 , out_channels = 192 , kernel_size = 3 , stride = 1 , padding = 1),\n             nn.BatchNorm2d(192),\n             nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n ​\n             InceptionBlock(192 , 64 , 96 , 128 , 16 , 32 , 32),#3a\n             InceptionBlock(256 , 128 , 128 , 192 , 32 , 96 , 64),#3b\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n ​\n             InceptionBlock(480 , 192 , 96 , 208 , 16 , 48 , 64),#4a\n             InceptionBlock(512 , 160 , 112 , 224 , 24 , 64 , 64),#4b\n             InceptionBlock(512 , 128 , 128 , 256 , 24 , 64 , 64),#4c\n             InceptionBlock(512 , 112 , 144 , 288 , 32 , 64 , 64),#4d\n             InceptionBlock(528 , 256 , 160 , 320 , 32 , 128 , 128),#4e\n             nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride=2 , padding=1),\n ​\n             InceptionBlock(832 , 256 , 160 , 320 , 32 , 128 , 128),#5a\n             InceptionBlock(832 , 384 , 192 , 384 , 48 , 128 , 128),#5b\n ​\n             nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1,1)),    \n             nn.Dropout(0.4),\n             nn.Flatten(),\n             nn.Linear(1024 , num_classes)\n         )\n     def forward(self , x):\n         return self.googleNet(x)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-lbsihas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-lbsihas","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GoogleNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的代码是依据上面的表格的，这个相关的流程图也放一下吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260206192324-pjaevbk","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-pjaevbk","updated":"20260206192419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260206192324-7cfnlyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192324-7cfnlyo","updated":"20260206192324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实在是太长了"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206192419-qw8nxyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206192419-qw8nxyg","updated":"20260206192420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260206192420-ex5qhkq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}